Adjust pH to 6.5. <br>
Distribute the medium into culture vessels (leave >80% volume gas phase), seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave. After cooling, add filter-sterilized methane gas to make a final concentration about 20% (v/v) methane in the gas phase.  <br>
